### 1. 分页查询商品（第1页，每页5条，搜索"教材"）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/product/page?page=1&pageSize=5&keyword=教材

### 2. 查询商品详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/product/1

### 3. 新增商品
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": 1,
  "title": "线性代数教材",
  "description": "同济第六版，有少量笔记",
  "price": 20.00,
  "originalPrice": 45.00,
  "category": "书籍教材",
  "condition": "八成新",
  "location": "东区宿舍"
}

### 4. 更新商品
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "线性代数教材（降价）",
  "price": 15.00
}

### 5. 删除商品
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/product/1
